<item>
<title>黄之锋再被判囚10年；欧盟：法治状况恶化；学者：想关多久就多久香港高等法院11月5日以“串谋勾结外国势力”罪判处黄之锋监</title>
<link>https://t.me/OutsightChina/10464</link>
<guid isPermaLink="true">https://t.me/OutsightChina/10464</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 02:48:14 +0000</pubDate>
<description><![CDATA[<div><div class="tgme_widget_message_text js-message_text" dir="auto"><b>黄之锋再被判囚10年；欧盟：法治状况恶化；学者：想关多久就多久</b><br/><br/>香港高等法院11月5日以“串谋勾结外国势力”罪判处黄之锋监禁10年。法官认定黄与罗冠聪在国安法后继续寻求外国制裁，罪行重大；新刑期仅2个月2日与“47人案”同期执行，原定明年1月获释的黄料服刑至2036年。<br/><br/>港府称黄认罪是“有力震慑”，特首李家超指黄、罗等人是破坏香港繁荣稳定的祸首之一，外交部亦称黄“罪行严重”。欧盟则谴责判刑具政治动机，称香港法治正在恶化，美国国会及行政当局中国委员会称香港司法正被武器化。<br/><br/>据美联社报道，观察人士认为当局意在尽量延长知名活动人士的刑期；伦敦大学学者曾锐生对彭博社称，判决传递出北京可随意关押挑战者的信息。中大讲师孔永乐则对《联合早报》称判决在法理与量刑上合理。<br/><br/><a href="?q=%23%E6%94%BF%E6%B2%BB">#政治</a> <a href="?q=%23%E5%9B%BD%E5%AE%89">#国安</a> <a href="?q=%23%E4%BA%BA%E6%9D%83">#人权</a> <a href="?q=%23%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF">#香港</a> <a href="?q=%23%E7%9C%8B%E9%89%B4">#看鉴</a><br/><br/><i class="emoji" style="background-image:url('//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9497.png')"><b>🔗</b></i>原文链接<br/>《香港01》<a href="https://www.hk01.com/article/60385666" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">黄之锋承认串谋勾结外国势力 被判囚10年 官指属罪行重大</a><br/>《法庭线》<a href="https://thewitnesshk.com/%e9%bb%83%e4%b9%8b%e9%8b%92%e5%88%a4%e5%9b%9a10%e5%b9%b4-%e9%99%b8%e5%a7%94%e6%9c%83%e4%bf%83%e5%81%9c%e6%94%bf%e6%b2%bb%e6%bf%ab%e8%a8%b4-%e5%9c%8b%e9%9a%9b%e7%89%b9%e8%b5%a6%e7%b1%b2%e6%92%a4/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">陆委会促停政治滥诉 国际特赦吁撤销定罪 港府：恶意攻击抹黑</a><br/>《美联社》<a href="https://apnews.com/article/hong-kong-joshua-wong-sentencing-national-security-f4b08dd23bab9912569e5cabd990c1ef" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">Hong Kong activist Joshua Wong sentenced to 10 more years in prison（香港社运人士黄之锋再被判囚10年）</a><br/>《彭博社》<a href="https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-05/hong-kong-sentences-activist-joshua-wong-to-10-years-in-prison" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">Hong Kong Sentences Activist Joshua Wong to 10 Years in Prison（香港判处社运人士黄之锋10年监禁）</a><br/>《联合早报》<a href="https://www.zaobao.com.sg/news/china/story20261105-9954790" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">黄之锋勾结外国势力罪追加10年监禁 出狱时或已40岁</a></div><p><img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/WE1mBurrg6ZpjsvwbBj4H4Sms72bpRDkjkEdJuJIBzYeO-D5TNEIjgHusRpR2x7VNK8ntry9dpF1t_ehOHzvkRTuvZwbHLwYEBjNVtNSUzR5ijvMr3vocRQKLsiGmo1q9yRr9p_LLVgNGgPS6cP3HnwXONl4_nBG49xbEymIdulnIDc1lEEfajxZlt_GdKFU1sQ-FhsA-lNbKp7HCk8MfQHXWjB2BcZ7HJpJi4ElHIIYdhSpCVcY2QR0MS_lzAmU2G0i_doXa3l3EZe0q2UPT34EW3Xm9w9XDm0xa_JleafloTb_nQwxjCQV6iFWxY4pL-6WSl6IQ4WW96lmr8ZKwQ.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/sOUev9DWeaIKOVYSRoWIaT1kwYsxzxH804RY29OTR7cqtfBpyagjYTO90dGMT69YKJg_D2wcHg_MVhLSS-cwb55RHajqPeizV9SrYHyRmf6_N_d8Xg4tbCESqi8vxvgiKrHV35-LU_YLeceOwsJz1wtVv_tXIaujyMgpCWRvpXHSaMvx26KgMuyc11NyxzHhXW_4waJWP9JotiIYXrm09LJ9PbLCblMyaEOfwQvVy9AaXji9ASr1kIvIehRxxaPlBDkcQ1TTYz48PFzAwEB3SuV4uCqSX8H5uxXC0YyIT3neBfBSNdHZKSsOeB2uuaGOk230aWgISxEKC227noNLBg.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/ZkNwV6GgCSwSK6HhP04G6zNPYSlUdRUyBxRqeH1cEmtKpFCei9eNUFnLgO9lNsFeTgQ-LfokNxGSPr8Fby0EWWGWsjYFhWlPFn71-tgLZp52M8kblJWP86fiOnM79BB425dg1KEO6vPjLsPwBvYf7F6FIP_zAw87RkgBg_1pom_ocy6A5Yvzp2o-p9WAzSjXpDpCzySuQpUjwCTWg4ELjEZk-1bdL09yhUZ2KfxPpSUT-Ey3eUy2glrZpB1NUOWURKprM8-vuJtGKVphZBdhKOP4BjWkgHduuKd4qZIH1fEi3pZAw1PyT_FlvAgUnK08fUQwczQXO21x7dCy_U_wjg.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/qUCHxAk3p7EUA7o44aSsWODv7Eh0o8y42sDyHRAECepP-RuCQrP--pgdfAFHk4wEcd32sXsb-PEiV7FfxGuSaR5vgue-sWHrZs6V20Nggym-ZoL1MyOX-wSSgDoOV0-Z7ogoH-x62MxoltizbCqOpL7HbEIeEznnQA4xg7Ul_eCYC-k2bpq6z6UrDRGSyoif0AEFKMuDz9gLUXdiK2qSXJv8qij5CPusdSJzWsENg3DnFmOBRNwbSgE2typG4DAgIbLVV6edN2sPat-KNCUH4jPRm5Qa6N-IueO8w8Nbbqj5DsjibVEgp3Ytm7cWCblpcRNp6vvDIWZjxgECXQbvUw.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-refe